  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Vintage Paratrooper Cargo Shorts are just what you need for the trail, range, and casual style. Crafted from a super soft and durable washed cotton / polyester twill, these military shorts provide a comfortable fit and feel that lasts. These cargo shorts are not afraid to get down and dirty, standing up during outdoor adventures and other rigorous conditions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "14788",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Vintage Paratrooper Cargo Shorts are just what you need for the trail, range, and casual style. Crafted from a super soft and durable washed cotton / polyester twill, these military shorts provide a comfortable fit and feel that lasts. These cargo shorts are not afraid to get down and dirty, standing up during outdoor adventures and other rigorous conditions. High-Capacity Storage: The hiking shorts provide functional utility through 2 large cargo pockets, 2 front slash pockets, and 2 back flap pockets for storing tactical gear and everyday essentials like your phone, wallet, keys, or multi-tool. Comfortable Zipper Fly: These tactical cargo shorts come equipped with a zipper fly for easy on and off that offers on-the-go convenience and comfort. Perfect Fit: The vintage military shorts feature an adjustable waistband drawstring on the inside that&rsquo;s designed to give you the perfect, custom fit, every time and anywhere. Timeless Style: Inspired by field-worn designs utilized by military personnel, the paratrooper cargo shorts combine comfort, durability, and functionality that is ideal for backpacking, camping, hiking, hunting, fishing, skateboarding, everyday wear, and more.</p>",
